    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13463" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπο-πλύνω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ</span>], fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῠνῶ,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wash well, wash away,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάϊγγας . . ἀποπλύνεσκε θάλασσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					6.95
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ περὶ τὴν γλῶτταν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					65d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς χεῖρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					9.409c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ βαφῆς ἀτόπου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					8.22
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>wash away,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Sens.</u>
				443b7
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			).</div>
